Chat for University of Oregon graduate students.
Run by grad students; not affiliated with the University of Oregon.

  /join #help           ask anything
  /msg NickServ REGISTER <password> <you@uoregon.edu>
                        get an account; the other channels need one
  /msg ALIS LIST *      see every channel

Channels marked "logged" on https://uogradnet.xyz/ are saved by the
chatlog bot. Private messages are never saved.

Source for everything: https://github.com/josephmcl/uogradnet
